/dist

# Game assets ARE committed — both the raw archives (/assets/) and the prepared
# web-ready output (public/assets/terrain/<slug>/).
#
# What is in here is community-authored mod data: TerraNova's EXP2b expansion and
# a community TerrainPack — 25-year-old freeware built for redistribution — held
# in a PUBLIC repo — the authors are this project's own mod team, who hold the
# rights and released it as freeware. Keeping the raw .pff/.trn/.pcx alongside the prepared PNGs
# means the pipeline is reproducible from source rather than depending on a
# working copy that lives on one machine.
#
# The line that still matters: RETAIL-extracted DF2 data is personal-use-only and
# does not go in here. See README § Asset policy and docs/01 §3.

# Raw local asset staging (the vegetation pipeline's input directory and other
# unprocessed sources). Never committed: prepared outputs go through
# tools/vegetation into tracked locations; the raw stash lives on one machine.
_tempAssets/

# Character source art too large for GitHub's 100 MB file limit (the raw 272 MB
# GLB) or redundant to it (.blend working files, loose texture exports). The
# compressed runtime GLB, the clip manifest, the retarget-source FBX pack and
# the docs ARE committed; the runtime copy lives in public/assets/characters/.
assets/3d/characters/player1/SpecialForcesSoldier.glb
assets/3d/characters/player1/*.blend*
assets/3d/characters/player1/textures/

# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store

# Local account database (SQLite). Created by `npm run game:server`.
account.db
account.db-shm
account.db-wal
# Retail-derived conversions. Personal-use-only, never committed (docs/01 §3).
# `local/` holds .3DI -> GLB models and imported missions.
public/assets/local/
# Prepared RETAIL terrains are symlinks into _tempAssets/. Named individually
# because sibling slugs here (egypt, gmile) come from community freeware and ARE
# committed — a blanket rule would drop those too.
public/assets/terrain/dfg4
public/assets/terrain/dfg5
public/assets/terrain/dmd3
